    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could build your own robot? What if you could poke it? Speak to it? Laugh with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MyRobot is a robot sandbox game with a TON of character interactions; from triggering emotions to customizations to engaging NPC conversations! All wrapped with silly gameplay and AI integration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>AI is optional</strong></u>\u00a0and you can host your own AI models for <u><strong>complete privacy</strong></u>. Alternatively you can use our online AI services or mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/0811f98d160609881d0eaa867877347f.avif?t=1755651515\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization is super important in MyRobot and everything you change about your robot is done in an intricate manner; you cut hair with scissors, color eyelashes with pens, and change hairstyles with hair combs. Want your robot to have fangs? Use the dental tool!\ud83e\uddb7\ud83d\udc43\ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc44\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/b497142c204698ac66267f80f2eaec34.avif?t=1755651515\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could build your own robot? What if you could poke it? Speak to it? Laugh with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MyRobot is a robot sandbox game with a TON of character interactions; from triggering emotions to customizations to engaging NPC conversations! All wrapped with silly gameplay and AI integration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>AI is optional</strong></u>\u00a0and you can host your own AI models for <u><strong>complete privacy</strong></u>. Alternatively you can use our online AI services or mix and match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/0811f98d160609881d0eaa867877347f.avif?t=1755651515\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization is super important in MyRobot and everything you change about your robot is done in an intricate manner; you cut hair with scissors, color eyelashes with pens, and change hairstyles with hair combs. Want your robot to have fangs? Use the dental tool!\ud83e\uddb7\ud83d\udc43\ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc44\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597510/extras/b497142c204698ac66267f80f2eaec34.avif?t=1755651515\" width=800 height=320 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "MyRobot is a robot sandbox game with optional AI features!",
